@style(IDocDemo)
@title(IDoc, by example)
@subtitle(Start here)

These files show everything IDoc can do, one topic per file. Each file is a working document: open it in IDoc and every example in it is live. Read the source beside the preview to see how each example is written.

@section(Reading order)

@ol
Write a document: the first file shows the basics everything else builds on.
Maths, then Questions and grading.
Variables and randomisation, then Exams on paper.
Papers and print, and Slides.
Code and Octo, if you teach with computation.
Studios and Charts, for interactive work.
Courses and Docent, to hand work to a class.
Signing, Accessibility and The editor, as you need them.
@end

